Cell["\<\
For two perpendicular neighbours of the centre of the grid the comparison \
scalar product is \[Minus]1, the value of two opposite ones. The tensor on \
the circle of radius 1 reads 0 for them, the plane's value at a right angle:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"0497aeeb-20db-4085-a69e-c68705d7d29e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

